window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Nothing prepared me on how to survive falling in love.</p> <p></p> <p>New day. New feelings. New threats.</p> <p></p> <p>I've survived in this post apocalyptic wasteland alone since I was twelve.</p> <p></p> <p>Never knowing intimacy or love.</p> <p></p> <p>Until Rex awoke feelings in me I don't understand.</p> <p></p> <p>The brash, controlling man is my first everything.</p> <p></p> <p>Yet I remain defiant, clinging to my independence, even if I'm possessive of him.</p> <p></p> <p>But when sickness strikes him down, fear of losing him consumes me.</p> <p></p> <p>Though I don't understand how to love, I'll shield him with everything I am.</p> <p></p> <p>Or die trying.</p> <p></p> <p>Because it’s my turn to protect the man who claimed me–the man I ache for–at all costs.</p> <p></p> <p>Grab this steamy short M/M dark and angsty romance set in a post apocalyptic world, featuring an OTT hero, an age-gap, and a touch of suspense.</p>"; 
